Rule 1 (broadcast compatibility for same-rank tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1)
>>
Rule 2 (broadcast compatibility when the second operand is 1D)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 then (shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, 0) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, 0) = 1)
>>
Rule 3 (broadcast compatibility when the first operand is 1D)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 1 then (shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) = shape(v_1, 0) ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, 0) = 1)
>>
Rule 4 (input tensors must not have complex or string dtypes)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 5 (input tensors must have non-zero dimension sizes)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (if ndim(v_1) > 0 then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0)) ∧ (if ndim(v_2) > 0 then (∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) > 0))
>>
Rule 7 (input tensors must have a maximum of 64 dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≤ 64 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≤ 64
>>
Rule 10 (the number of dimensions for both input tensors must not exceed 32)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≤ 32 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≤ 32
>>
Rule 11 (broadcasting compatibility for 2D-2D tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 2 then (shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0) ∨ shape(v_1, 0) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, 0) = 1) ∧ (shape(v_1, 1) = shape(v_2, 1) ∨ shape(v_1, 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, 1) = 1)
>>
Rule 12 (broadcasting compatibility for 3D-3D tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 3 then (shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0) ∨ shape(v_1, 0) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, 0) = 1) ∧ (shape(v_1, 1) = shape(v_2, 1) ∨ shape(v_1, 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, 1) = 1) ∧ (shape(v_1, 2) = shape(v_2, 2) ∨ shape(v_1, 2) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, 2) = 1)
>>
Rule 13 (limit on the number of dimensions for both input tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ ndim(v_1) ≤ 8 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≤ 8
